This photo shows the leftovers after a meal, so only small residues remain. There is an orange, cheesy or egg-like smear on the main plate, a few green and dark bits in the bowl, and some crumbs on the front plate.

I estimated roughly 15 g of residue on the main plate at about 2 kcal/g (~30 kcal), 5 g in the bowl (~8 kcal), and 2 g of crumbs (~6 kcal). That comes to about 22 g of food and roughly 45 kcal.

